TITLE Acid Mine Drainage - Anoxic Limestone Drain Treatment Model
# Model for Blackwood Creek ALD treating acid sulfate water
# 5-meter drain, 10 cells, crushed limestone media

SOLUTION 0  AMD Influent
    units   mg/L
    temp    15
    pH      3.0
    pe      4.0
    Ca      150
    Mg      40
    Na      30
    S(6)    600
    Cl      20
    K       5

SOLUTION 1-10  Initial porewater in drain cells
    units   mg/L
    temp    15
    pH      7.5
    pe      4.0
    Ca      60
    Mg      5
    Na      10
    K       2
    S(6)    20
    Cl      10

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1-10
    Calcite    -2.0    5.0
    Gypsum     0.0     0.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file    /app/transport_results.tsv
    -saturation_indices  Calcite Gypsum

TRANSPORT
    -cells   10
    -shifts  30
    -time_step  3600
    -flow_direction  forward
    -boundary_conditions  constant  constant
    -lengths  0.5
    -dispersivities  1.0

END
